{"seq":3,"slug":"substitute-valuation-methods-selection-order","title":"替代估价方法的适用序列与选择实务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/customs-valuation-transaction-value-firstsale-engineering/customs-valuation-agreement-legal-model/substitute-valuation-methods-selection-order","wordCount":3155,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"替代估价方法的适用序列与选择实务\">替代估价方法的适用序列与选择实务</h1><p>一票从越南发往洛杉矶的蓝牙音箱，进口商与卖方是关联公司，海关审单时认定成交价格&quot;未经充分证明&quot;而不可接受。此时完税价格不会凭空消失，而是<strong>必须沿法定顺序继续下探</strong>——先看是否有关税时点前后出口到同一关境的相同货物成交价，再看类似货物，再看倒扣价格或计算价格，最后才落到合理方法。本文处理的正是这一段落：当第一顺位的成交价格法（Article 1）被排除后，海关与进口商如何在<strong>六项估价方法</strong>中找到下一个合法落点，以及选错顺序会带来怎样的补税与罚则后果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-一个强制的下探序列-而非可自由挑选的菜单\">核心概念：一个强制的下探序列，而非可自由挑选的菜单</h2><p>《WTO 海关估价协定》（即 GATT 1994 第七条实施协定，Agreement on Implementation of Article VII of GATT 1994，下称&quot;协定&quot;）在 Article 1 到 Article 7 里规定了<strong>六种</strong>估价方法，并按顺序强制适用：只有当上一顺位方法&quot;无法确定&quot;时，才允许进入下一顺位。这个顺序不是建议，而是协定 Article 7 第 1 款和海关法国内法化的硬性要求。</p>\n<p>六种方法的顺位、法条与消极条件如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>顺位</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>协定法条</th>\n<th>触发/排除条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>成交价格法</td>\n<td>Art. 1</td>\n<td>交易真实、无不得使用的限制、价格未受无法量化的条件影响、关联方交易未影响价格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>相同货物成交价格</td>\n<td>Art. 2</td>\n<td>相同货物、同一出口国、关税时点上下同一时期（通常 ±90 天内）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>类似货物成交价格</td>\n<td>Art. 3</td>\n<td>类似货物、其余同 Art. 2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>倒扣价格法</td>\n<td>Art. 5</td>\n<td>以进口国国内转售价格倒扣各项费用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>计算价格法</td>\n<td>Art. 6</td>\n<td>以生产成本 + 利润与管理费用正推</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>合理方法</td>\n<td>Art. 7</td>\n<td>在前五者基础上灵活适用，但受 Art. 7.2 消极清单限制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个关键的<strong>顺序可变点</strong>是 Art. 4：<strong>应进口商请求，Art. 5 与 Art. 6 的顺序可以颠倒</strong>（即先算计算价格、再算倒扣价格）。这是全序列中唯一法律明文允许的互换，其余顺位一律不可跳级——不能因为倒扣价格&quot;好算&quot;就绕过相同货物。中国《海关审定进出口货物完税价格办法》（海关总署令第 213 号）在第二十至二十七条逐条落地了这一序列，欧盟 UCC (Regulation (EU) No 952/2013) Article 70 与实施条例 (EU) 2015/2447 亦同构。</p>\n<p>下面这张图是每次替代估价都必须走的判定路径：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[成交价格 Article 1 被排除] --&gt; B{存在相同货物?}&#10;  B --&gt;|是, 同国同期| C[适用 Article 2&lt;br/&gt;相同货物成交价]&#10;  B --&gt;|否| D{存在类似货物?}&#10;  D --&gt;|是, 同国同期| E[适用 Article 3&lt;br/&gt;类似货物成交价]&#10;  D --&gt;|否| F{进口商请求颠倒?}&#10;  F --&gt;|请求 Art.4| G[先算 Article 6&lt;br/&gt;计算价格]&#10;  F --&gt;|未请求| H[先算 Article 5&lt;br/&gt;倒扣价格]&#10;  G --&gt; I{可得?}&#10;  H --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt;|否| J[Article 7 合理方法]&#10;  I --&gt;|是| K[确定完税价格]&#10;  J --&gt; L{触碰 Art.7.2 禁止项?}&#10;  L --&gt;|是| M[重选, 不得违禁]&#10;  L --&gt;|否| K\">graph TD\n  A[成交价格 Article 1 被排除] --&gt; B{存在相同货物?}\n  B --&gt;|是, 同国同期| C[适用 Article 2&lt;br/&gt;相同货物成交价]\n  B --&gt;|否| D{存在类似货物?}\n  D --&gt;|是, 同国同期| E[适用 Article 3&lt;br/&gt;类似货物成交价]\n  D --&gt;|否| F{进口商请求颠倒?}\n  F --&gt;|请求 Art.4| G[先算 Article 6&lt;br/&gt;计算价格]\n  F --&gt;|未请求| H[先算 Article 5&lt;br/&gt;倒扣价格]\n  G --&gt; I{可得?}\n  H --&gt; I\n  I --&gt;|否| J[Article 7 合理方法]\n  I --&gt;|是| K[确定完税价格]\n  J --&gt; L{触碰 Art.7.2 禁止项?}\n  L --&gt;|是| M[重选, 不得违禁]\n  L --&gt;|否| K</pre><p>图里最容易被工程实现忽略的，是 F 分支——<strong>颠倒请求是一项由进口商主动行使的程序权利</strong>，报关系统若把 Art. 5 写死在前，等于默认剥夺了它。</p>\n<h2 id=\"方法二与三-相同-类似货物的-同国同期-门槛\">方法二与三：相同/类似货物的&quot;同国同期&quot;门槛</h2><p>Art. 2 与 Art. 3 是两个结构完全平行的方法，区别只在&quot;相同货物（identical goods）&quot;与&quot;类似货物（similar goods）&quot;的定义差别。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>相同货物</strong>：在所有方面都相同，包括物理特征、质量和信誉；仅因外观细微差异不构成不同（协定 Art. 15.2(a) 及解释性说明）。</li>\n<li><strong>类似货物</strong>：在特征和组成材料上相似，能完成相同功能、在商业上可互换；货物质量与信誉是判断要素（Art. 15.2(b)）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>两者共享三个严苛的适用条件，缺一不可：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>同一出口国</strong>生产或出口——不能拿韩国的相似货物来给越南货物估价；</li>\n<li><strong>关税时点前后同一时期</strong>出口到同一进口国，实务中多国海关以 ±90 天为界；</li>\n<li>交易须为<strong>往同一进口国销售的、无关联方影响的、真实成交</strong>（association 情形须按 Art. 15.4 判断是否影响价格）。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>若存在多笔可比成交，协定要求取<strong>最低</strong>的那一笔或按合理加权选定——不是取平均、更不是取最高。这一点与 Art. 7.2&quot;不得选取两者中的较高者&quot;的禁止项同源：协定的价值取向是保护进口商的确定性，避免估价被用作变相加税的工具。</p>\n<p>相同货物本身也可能需要调整（adjustment），例如运输距离不同、数量级不同（quantity discounts）。Art. 2.1(b) 明确允许在能客观量化、有书面证据的前提下调整差异；<strong>无法量化的差异只能作为排除该笔可比交易的理由，而不能拍脑袋估一个调整额</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"方法四与五-倒扣价格与计算价格的两条逆向路径\">方法四与五：倒扣价格与计算价格的两条逆向路径</h2><p>这两项方法在教科书里常被合并讲，但它们的<strong>信息可得性</strong>截然相反，这正是 Art. 4 颠倒权存在的原因。</p>\n<p>**倒扣价格法（Art. 5）**从进口国国内的转售价往回扣。其最有代表性的形态是 Art. 5.1(a)：以进口货物、相同或类似货物在被估价货物进口时&quot;在同一销售环节、最大合计数量&quot;下的国内转售单价为基础，扣除：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CV_{ded} = P_{unit} - C_{comm} - C_{inland} - T_{import} - C_{post}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ni</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mm</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">im</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">os</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{unit}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ni</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为国内转售单价，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{comm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mm</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为通常的佣金、利润与一般费用，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{inland}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为进口后发生的运输保险，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{import}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">im</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为关税与国内税，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{post}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">os</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为进口后增值加工成本。Art. 5.1(b) 还给了替代形态：用<strong>进口后未加工的货物</strong>转售价倒扣。</p>\n<p>**计算价格法（Art. 6）**则从出口方成本正推：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CV_{comp} = C_{mat} + C_{prod} + C_{profit}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{mat}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为原材料与装配成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{prod}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为其他生产成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{profit}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为出口国同类货物通常的利润与一般费用。它的问题在于：<strong>全部数据在境外生产商手里</strong>，进口国海关通常拿不到，除非境外厂商自愿配合。这就是为什么协定给进口商 Art. 4 的颠倒权——当进口商有能力从自己的境外供应商处取得成本明细时，Art. 6 反而比 Art. 5 更快落地。</p>\n<p>一项实务红线：Art. 6 项下<strong>不得要求非居民（non-resident）生产商提交账册以供核查</strong>，也不能因对方位于境外就拒绝其提供的计算数据（协定关于 Art. 6 的解释性说明）。这条边界是把计算价格法从&quot;不可用&quot;变成&quot;可用&quot;的关键。</p>\n<h2 id=\"方法六-合理方法的边界与-art-7-2-消极清单\">方法六：合理方法的边界与 Art. 7.2 消极清单</h2><p>Art. 7 是兜底条款，它允许海关&quot;在更大弹性下&quot;适用前五种方法，但<strong>不是没有边界的自由裁量</strong>。Art. 7.2 列明了五类绝对禁止的估价做法，实务中违反其中任何一条都会导致估价决定被复议或诉讼推翻：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>禁止项</th>\n<th>内涵</th>\n<th>常见误用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>进口国国内自产货物售价</td>\n<td>不得用本国同类产品的国内销售价作基础</td>\n<td>拿国产替代品的市场价充数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>选取较高者</td>\n<td>不得在两种可比值之间取高</td>\n<td>在相同/类似货物两笔价中取高价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>出口国国内市场价格</td>\n<td>不得用货物在出口国的国内售价</td>\n<td>用越南本土零售价估价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>除 Art. 6 外以生产成本推算</td>\n<td>不得绕过方法序列直接算成本</td>\n<td>跳过 Art. 2/3 直接正推成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>任意或虚构价格</td>\n<td>不得使用无客观依据的数值</td>\n<td>用系统默认值或历史残值填数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Art. 7.1 同时要求：合理方法须以<strong>在进口国可获得的、且与该国商业实践一致的数据</strong>为基础，并优先考虑此前已用过的成交价（同一出口商对同一进口国的、依据已确立的估价）。工程化翻译就是——<strong>合理方法必须落在一个可追溯的数据来源上，而不是一个&quot;兜底常数&quot;</strong>。</p>\n<p>一个经常滥用的口径是把 Art. 7 包装成&quot;海关说多少就多少&quot;。事实上《协定》第 11 条赋予了进口商<strong>书面说明要求权与司法复议权</strong>：海关作出估价决定时应书面告知依据，进口商有权要求复核并诉诸司法，且<strong>缴纳关税不应成为申请复议的前置条件</strong>（Art. 11.2）。这条救济权是替代估价实务中最值得写进报关流程的合规锚点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"选择实务-把序列判定做成可执行流程\">选择实务：把序列判定做成可执行流程</h2><p>对跨境电商工程团队而言，替代估价的选择不是法务一次性的判断，而是<strong>报关前必须预判、留痕、可举证</strong>的流程。三条落地要点：</p>\n<p><strong>第一，先穷尽 Art. 1，再谈替代。</strong> 绝大多数替代估价争议的根源，其实在 Art. 1 阶段就该堵住——关联交易未申报、特许权使用费（royalty）未计入、协助费（assist）漏报。只有把这些调整做扎实、并保留书面证据，成交价格法才有立得住的前提；否则一旦被排除，进口商就失去了确定性最高、对自身最有利的方法。</p>\n<p><strong>第二，颠倒权要主动行使并留档。</strong> 若供应链结构使得境外供应商愿意提供成本明细，报关前就应在申报中明确提出 Art. 4 请求，把 Art. 6 提前。反之若境内有成熟的转售价格数据、而境外成本拿不到，则应保持在 Art. 5。这项选择往往是数个百分点税负的分野。</p>\n<p><strong>第三，为每个顺位准备可核验的证据包。</strong> Art. 2/3 需要同国同期的可比成交记录；Art. 5 需要国内转售台账与费用分摊；Art. 6 需要生产成本明细；Art. 7 需要数据来源说明。<strong>没有证据的&quot;哪一顺位都可&quot;，在稽查时等同于哪一顺位都不成立</strong>。</p>\n<p>以下对照表可作为报关系统里选择逻辑的骨架：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>输入信号</th>\n<th>指向的顺位</th>\n<th>需要的证据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>存在无关联方同国同期相同货物成交</td>\n<td>Art. 2</td>\n<td>成交合同、发票、原产地证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无相同有类似货物成交</td>\n<td>Art. 3</td>\n<td>功能/材料对比说明、成交证据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有国内转售价格、境外成本不可得</td>\n<td>Art. 5（先）</td>\n<td>转售台账、佣金/税费分摊表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进口商已提出颠倒请求、境外成本可得</td>\n<td>Art. 6（先）</td>\n<td>生产成本表、出口国利润佐证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>以上均不可得</td>\n<td>Art. 7</td>\n<td>数据来源说明、商业实践一致性论证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>六项估价方法是<strong>强制下探序列</strong>，Art. 1 成交价格法为第一顺位，被排除后才逐级下探至 Art. 7 合理方法。</li>\n<li>全序列中<strong>唯一允许互换</strong>的是 Art. 5（倒扣）与 Art. 6（计算），且须由进口商主动请求（Art. 4）；其余顺位不得跳级。</li>\n<li>Art. 2/3 的相同/类似货物必须满足<strong>同出口国、关税时点前后同期、真实成交</strong>三条件；多笔可比时取低不取高。</li>\n<li>倒扣价格法依赖进口国转售数据，计算价格法依赖境外生产成本数据；数据可得性决定哪一项更现实，这正是颠倒权的价值。</li>\n<li>Art. 7.2 是<strong>消极清单</strong>：禁止用国内售价、出口国国内价、两值取高、任意虚构价，也不得绕过前五种方法直接推算成本。</li>\n<li>进口商享有书面说明要求权与司法复议权（Art. 11），这是替代估价实务中最应写入流程的合规保障。</li>\n<li>工程落地的核心是&quot;证据先行&quot;：为每个顺位准备可核验的证据包，避免以&quot;兜底常数&quot;冒充合理方法。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>参考来源：WTO《Agreement on Implementation of Article VII of GATT 1994》Articles 1–7、15 及解释性说明；WCO Technical Committee on Customs Valuation Advisory Opinions；中国《海关审定进出口货物完税价格办法》（海关总署令第 213 号）；欧盟 UCC (Regulation (EU) No 952/2013) Article 70 与 Commission Implementing Regulation (EU) 2015/2447；美国 CBP 19 CFR Part 152 Valuation。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"替代估价方法的适用序列与选择实务","id":"替代估价方法的适用序列与选择实务"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：一个强制的下探序列，而非可自由挑选的菜单","id":"核心概念-一个强制的下探序列-而非可自由挑选的菜单"},{"level":2,"text":"方法二与三：相同/类似货物的\"同国同期\"门槛","id":"方法二与三-相同-类似货物的-同国同期-门槛"},{"level":2,"text":"方法四与五：倒扣价格与计算价格的两条逆向路径","id":"方法四与五-倒扣价格与计算价格的两条逆向路径"},{"level":2,"text":"方法六：合理方法的边界与 Art. 7.2 消极清单","id":"方法六-合理方法的边界与-art-7-2-消极清单"},{"level":2,"text":"选择实务：把序列判定做成可执行流程","id":"选择实务-把序列判定做成可执行流程"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"成交价格法的构成要件与不可适用情形","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/customs-valuation-transaction-value-firstsale-engineering/customs-valuation-agreement-legal-model/transaction-value-conditions-of-acceptance"},"next":{"title":"成交价格调整项模型：法定加项与减项的界定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/customs-valuation-transaction-value-firstsale-engineering/transaction-value-adjustment-firstsale/adjustment-additions-deductions-model"}}